{"id":10037,"name":"alakazam-mega","speciesId":65,"dex":65,"form":"mega","generation":1,"types":["psychic"],"stats":{"hp":55,"attack":50,"defense":65,"special-attack":175,"special-defense":105,"speed":150},"abilities":[{"name":"trace","hidden":false}],"height":12,"weight":480,"baseExp":270,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10037.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10037.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10037.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10037.ogg","genus":"Psi Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon psi","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Its brain can out­ perform a super­ computer. Its intelligence quotient is said to be 5,000."},{"version":"yellow","text":"A POKéMON that can memorize anything. It never forgets what it learns-- that's why this POKéMON is smart."},{"version":"gold","text":"Closing both its eyes heightens all its other senses. This enables it to use its abilities to their extremes."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its brain cells multiply continu­ ally until it dies. As a result, it remembers everything."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It has an IQ of 5000. It calcu­ lates many things in order to gain the edge in every battle."},{"version":"ruby","text":"ALAKAZAM’s brain continually grows, making its head far too heavy to support with its neck. This POKéMON holds its head up using its psychokinetic power instead."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"ALAKAZAM’s brain continually grows, infinitely multiplying brain cells. This amazing brain gives this POKéMON an astoundingly high IQ of 5,000. It has a thorough memory of everything that has occurred in the world."},{"version":"emerald","text":"While it has strong psychic abilities and high intelligence, an ALAKAZAM’s muscles are very weak. It uses psychic power to move its body."},{"version":"firered","text":"It does not like physical attacks very much. Instead, it freely uses extra­ sensory powers to defeat foes."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Its brain can outperform a supercomputer. Its IQ (intelligence quotient) is said to be around 5,000."},{"version":"diamond","text":"Its superb memory lets it recall everything it has experienced from birth. Its IQ exceeds 5,000."},{"version":"pearl","text":"Its highly developed brain is on par with a supercomputer. It can use all forms of psychic abilities."},{"version":"platinum","text":"The spoons clutched in its hands are said to have been created by its psychic powers."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Its brain cells multiply continually until it dies. As a result, it remembers everything."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Alakazam’s brain continually grows, making its head far too heavy to support with its neck. This Pokémon holds its head up using its psychokinetic power instead."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Alakazam’s brain continually grows, infinitely multiplying brain cells. This amazing brain gives this Pokémon an astoundingly high IQ of 5,000. It has a thorough memory of everything that has occurred in the world."},{"version":"sun","text":"It is said to have an IQ of approximately 5,000. Its overflowing psychokinetic powers cause headaches to anyone nearby."},{"version":"moon","text":"Its brain cells continue to increase in number until its death. The older the Alakazam, the larger its head."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Alakazam uses its psychic powers to make the spoons it carries. Each spoon is an original that there’s only one of in the whole world."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"If it trusts someone deeply, it will let them have one of its spoons. Anything you eat with that spoon is apparently delicious."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"A Pokémon that can memorize anything. It never forgets what it learns—that’s why this Pokémon is smart."},{"version":"sword","text":"It has an incredibly high level of intelligence. Some say that Alakazam remembers everything that ever happens to it, from birth till death."},{"version":"shield","text":"Alakazam wields potent psychic powers. It’s said that this Pokémon used these powers to create the spoons it holds."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"The longer Alakazam lives, the larger and heavier its head becomes. Our tests have shown that the strength of its psychic powers correlates positively to the weight of its head."}],"flavorPt":"Quanto mais Alakazam vive, maior e mais pesada se torna sua cabeça. Nossos testes mostraram que a força dos seus poderes psíquicos se correlaciona positivamente com o peso da sua cabeça.","genderRate":2,"captureRate":50,"eggGroups":["humanshape"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"abra","speciesId":63,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 16"],"species":"kadabra","speciesId":64,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Troca"],"species":"alakazam","speciesId":65,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":65,"name":"alakazam","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/65.png"},{"id":10037,"name":"alakazam-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10037.png"}],"games":[15,16,17,18,19],"moves":[{"id":7,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":8,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":9,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":50,"learn":[[15,"lv",18],[16,"lv",18],[17,"lv",18],[18,"lv",18],[19,"lv",1],[19,"lv",6]]},{"id":60,"learn":[[15,"lv",28],[16,"lv",21],[17,"lv",21],[18,"lv",21],[19,"lv",1]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":69,"learn":[[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":86,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19